y Notification No. S.O. 475(E) dated 1-7-1989.</p><p class=\"fn\"><sup>2</sup> The Schedule renumbered as the First Schedule thereof by Act 54 of 1994, s. 63 (w.e.f. 14-11-1994).</p></div></div></article>",
